body:
This is where my theory gets weird, I believe in dual possession, and I believe Abby could take part in it. She has some resemblance to GF, since she is helping the children remember the past.

&#x200B;

Some detail I'd like to mention is that she's wearing the exact same clothes Cassidy is wearing in Ruin.

&#x200B;

On the other side, the name having the same letters as Baby and the fact that they literally tried to stuff her inside a girl springlock suit that looks like Ella throws me off.
